<para>
  The <classname>RationalizeMethod</classname> class is used as the
  value of the <varname>method</varname> parameter for the <xref
  linkend="RegisteredClass-Rationalize"/> &skel; <link
  linkend="RegisteredClass-SkeletonModifier">modifier</link>.  It
  determines whether the various rationalization <link
  linkend="RegisteredClass-Rationalizer">tools</link> will be applied
  <link
  linkend="RegisteredClass-AutomaticRationalization">automatically</link>
  or under <link
  linkend="RegisteredClass-SpecificRationalization">user
  control</link>.
</para>


